        }
      ],
      "words": 73
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“S'okay,” I say, and he smiles like he knows I'm fumbling with my thoughts. I turn and start walking towards the main do",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4637
        },
        {
          "text": "“I'd follow you anywhere, Flour.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4795
        },
        {
          "text": "I glance over my shoulder, expecting to find his eyes on my butt, but he's watching my face",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4826
