      ],
      "words": 55
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“I told Bailey the truth about all those years I wasn't in his life,” Max utters into the darkness",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4982
        },
        {
          "text": "I turn and catch his eye. “How did he take it?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5079
        },
        {
          "text": "“I think he'll process it for a while and talk about it in therapy. But",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5125
        },
        {
          "text": "it was good. Like really good.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5195
        }
      ],
      "words": 52
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Do you struggle when you're with me?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6958
        },
        {
          "text": "“No,” I tell him, “but sometimes I get anxious about asking for what I want.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6994
        },
        {
          "text": "His fingertips hang in the air as if he wants to caress me. “I get scared as well. Never apologise for asking for what y",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7068
        },
        {
          "text": "My heart skitters at this loaded conversation. “Even now?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7271
        },
        {
          "text": "“Especially now.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7328
        }
      ],
      "words": 75
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "And then his mouth dives to mine. Where I expected frenzy, I get soft. Gentle, even. Goosebumps rise on my arms, and his",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7458
        }
      ],
      "words": 49
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Every time it looks like you're overthinking, I'm going to pause until you're begging to ride my fingers. Are we clear?",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8237
        },
        {
          "text": "My hips move of their own accord, seeking the friction again. “Yes, Max.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8382
        },
        {
          "text": "This was what I needed. He gets my head, and that means more than he'll ever know",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8454
        }
      ],
      "words": 58
    },
    {
      "block": "原句10",
      "no": 10,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "But I don't care. My anxiety will never leave me, but Max's words silence the intrusive thoughts",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10308
        }
      ],
      "words": 17
    },
    {
      "block": "原句11",
      "no": 11,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“The next time you get anxious, you come to me. Are we agreed?”",
          "ok": true,
